<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mid-America.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mid-America.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it lowered its recommendation on Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 to 25-3/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
